      "content": "i mean i know i should probably go but i honestly cant right now. shit is expensive and my insurance is a nightmare to deal with. plus the hole isnt even that big, it just looks a bit red around the edges. if i just soak it in some antiseptic and wrap it up tight with a bandage, that should keep the germs out, right? i feel like i can handle this myself if i just keep it super clean.",
